            "detailed_description": "<h1>Complete Pack &amp; Everything Pack</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/18400/extras/2047aba20a2bbad7989d73c26e548da3.avif?t=1447351367\" width=586 height=192 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/18400/extras/941df970efa165eb098df04e2dc44c0a.avif?t=1447351367\" width=586 height=192 /></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Crazy Machines 2 is packed with all new features to help you create your wackiest &quot;Rube Goldberg-style&quot; contraptions yet! All new elements, plus an amazing 3D physics engine lets you craft even more complex gadgets and effects. <br>\t\t\t\t\tGo on tour with the crazy professor and put your skills to the test with challenges from around the globe. Travel, from the bazaars of Egypt to the white sands of the Caribbean, then blast off into space for an out of this world gaming experience. Check out the crazy machines community online! Post machines you've created and download those made by others. Compete for tropies and high ratings.                    <br>\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All new &quot;Rube Goldberg-style&quot; puzzles                         <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Over 150 elements to create and destroy through 200 levels!                        <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>World tour, online, and free-style game modes                        <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>All new parts: amazing lightning machines and laser beams!                        <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Hall of Fame: Win a trophy for your contraption                        <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Fun for the whole family                        <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Online community!                        <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Incredible 3D graphics with brand new effects!                        <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Ageia PhysX hardware support                    </li></ul>",
